4:["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$Le",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L10",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Destinations"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"ACCOMODATION"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"HOW TO FIND A RIGHT ACCOMODATION. Finding a right accommodation in abroad is not just piece of cake. You have to check every single detail before getting your perfect accommodation. Abroad could be very taxing and risky at the same time. But, if seen isn’t risk everywhere? Getting a perfect accommodation could be overwhelming but with right knowledge and research you won’t have a lot on your plate to deal with. Many people tend to delay the accommodation part while dealing with visa or admission process and because of this you end up facing difficulties to find a right accommodation."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","The guide",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The guide"}],[["$","p","For Indian students the task difficulty increases as they need apartments, hostels with Indian students who are already staying. The mindset of staying with people of same country could look easy and fun but it could also stop you from exploring yourself and getting to know new people in the new country /city . You need to make yourself flexible enough to adjust with anyone and anywhere.",{"children":"For Indian students the task difficulty increases as they need apartments, hostels with Indian students who are already staying. The mindset of staying with people of same country could look easy and fun but it could also stop you from exploring yourself and getting to know new people in the new country /city . You need to make yourself flexible enough to adjust with anyone and anywhere."}],["$","p","Besides, finding a right accommodation is the big question here. Don’t worry you are on the right article , we got you!",{"children":"Besides, finding a right accommodation is the big question here. Don’t worry you are on the right article , we got you!"}],["$","p","(photo)",{"children":"(photo)"}],["$","p","One of the most important factor of abroad is the living. There are so many variety of options available for a student to accommodate",{"children":"One of the most important factor of abroad is the living. There are so many variety of options available for a student to accommodate"}],["$","p",". Like studio apartments, hostels, pg’s , university housing, dorms or lofts.",{"children":". Like studio apartments, hostels, pg’s , university housing, dorms or lofts."}],["$","p","Uni housing can be in campus or close to campus. If you want to save time and money university housing is a good option but, again university housing is based on first come first serve basis.",{"children":"Uni housing can be in campus or close to campus. If you want to save time and money university housing is a good option but, again university housing is based on first come first serve basis."}],["$","p","It’s also important to check basic factors and needs before finalizing the apartment. Afterall, this is a major decision which shouldn’t be made in hurry because you will be living,eating,studying,sleeping etc there. You have to make sure of lot of things before selecting your RIGHT accommodation.",{"children":"It’s also important to check basic factors and needs before finalizing the apartment. Afterall, this is a major decision which shouldn’t be made in hurry because you will be living,eating,studying,sleeping etc there. You have to make sure of lot of things before selecting your RIGHT accommodation."}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16"],"$L17"]}],"$L18"]}],"$L19"]}]}],"$L1a"]}]
