1d:["$","p","Finding accommodation could be challenging but with the right website and the right guidance you got it all covered.",{"children":"Finding accommodation could be challenging but with the right website and the right guidance you got it all covered."}]
1e:["$","p","Make sure you choose your apartment wisely after looking at all the points above mentioned. You have to keep in mind that you won’t always meet your expectations but make sure your basic needs are met.",{"children":"Make sure you choose your apartment wisely after looking at all the points above mentioned. You have to keep in mind that you won’t always meet your expectations but make sure your basic needs are met."}]
